The feathery descent spell protects the recipient from a fatal fall by
slowing their plummet.  This allows the recipient to fall further before
certain problems (broken bones, outright death, etc) occur, and also
decreases the damage of the fall.

Duration depends on the caster's level.

Feathery descent can be cast on yourself, on another character, or with
no target to buff your group members in the room.
